<!--
    Super Street Fighter II EX, EX edition patch (rc9)
    An unofficial fan edition of Super Street Fighter II X: Grand Master Challenge (Japan 940311): Shin and Ten Akuma, the bonus stages, Tournament Battle and more, in a USA build and a Japanese build.

    Patch by Steve Gordon (https://x.com/strygo).

    This is a patch-overlay MRA: it references the ORIGINAL, unmodified
    MAME romset (ssf2xj.zip) and applies the edition in memory
    while the game loads. It contains no ROM data. Settings and saves use
    the name 'ssf2xuc'.

    Base MRA and jtcps2 core by Jose Tejada (jotego); see his header below.
    Not affiliated with or endorsed by Capcom. Free patch; do not sell.
-->
